WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.200
We demand that businesses like the Yards Plaza, owned by Freeman Properties, stop giving immigration

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:12.000
authorities access to their parking lots.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.240
Stop enabling them to carry out even more terror in our neighborhoods.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:22.000
You never see the left fight this hard for Americans.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.379
If they can just take 10% of the effort they're wasting on criminal illegals and have it used

00:00:27.379 --> 00:00:30.139
on us, the country would be in great shape.

